-August poll had Kirschner narrowly ahead. A Democratic-leaning national environment and some crossover frustration among local Republicans could keep the race closer than typical for this seat. Prediction markets give Kirschner roughly a one-in-five chance. An independent candidate on the ballot adds minor uncertainty but is unlikely to decide the outcome.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.257, "margin": -3.74}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2349, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1906, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2331, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.1854, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.1943, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.2766, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.2403, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.2304, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.1856, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.2293, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.2161, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.1956, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.2245, "margin": -4.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.1476, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.1845, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.2054, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.1344, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.1177, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.1473, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.1655, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.2056, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.1774, "margin": -6.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.1046, "margin": -7.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.1701, "margin": -5.5}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.1881, "margin": -5.0}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "p_dem": 0.1864, "margin": -4.8}]}